    verification touchedSetDescendsTheWorkspaceImplementGate : Test { :>> id = "d8706e38-d8a2-492b-8afd-722765a4587b"; :>> title = "Sprint 741 implement gate"; :>> createdAt = "2026-09-18"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "The implement gate is the DoD's own probes plus the ladder: cargo clippy --workspace --release --all-targets clean after missing_const_for_fn (nothing_to_run -> pub const fn), too_many_lines on run() twice (member-row attribution moved into run_member_libs as MemberLibs.failing, choose_runner extracted), redundant_clone and cloned_ref_to_slice_refs (std::slice::from_ref); cargo build --release Finished and target/release/keel-serve.exe refreshed from it; cargo test -p keel-suite --release --lib 61 passed 0 failed; the converted integration binaries pass (activation_round_trip_loses_nothing 4, capability_refusal_bites 9, control_census_names_friction 1, no_op_writes_lose_nothing 7, resync_is_not_a_self_modification 3, tests_bind_to_properties 6, touched_tests_run_before_land 5, unknown_flag_is_refused 4, wrapper_resolves_only_the_pin 7); grep -rl CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR keel-cli/tests = 0 files, 18 files name test_support::; python pos741.py pass (exit 0, test result: ok. 2 passed); python neg741.py pass (fallback narrowed 2 passed; planted reach exit 101 naming zz_probe741_unrecorded_reach.rs:3 CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR, plant removed); keel gate guard --no-receipt ALL PASS; keel gate check-engine clean; keel sync-claude --check matches (47 registry skills); gh run list for d7ffcc82 conclusion success. Three tests were corrected against their own fixtures before they passed: the round-trip test counted reads_key twice because the receipt header names the field (now matched as a line), the recorder-key test's set was unsorted while split sorts, and a nextest member-row assertion borrowed a temporary."; }
